				1490,
				4
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Reorder resources block and fix documentation links\n\nCorrect the ordering of files within the Tauri `resources` configuration in `tauri.conf.json` to group JavaScript bootstrap files prior to static assets and configuration manifests. This restores the logical dependency sequence expected during the application bundle initialization process.\n\nUpdate GitHub documentation URLs in `README.md` and `Documentation/GitHub/NamingConventions.md` from the legacy `blob` path to the canonical `tree` path, ensuring links correctly resolve to directory listings and file views on the `Current` branch.\n\nAlign dash formatting in `Source/Binary/Build/Scheme.rs` comments to use standard hyphens instead of en-dashes for code path descriptions.\n\nThese changes ensure consistent configuration loading and accurate external documentation references.",
			"SHA": "53fdb1751c9017d8a5dcc41e9007e44d52464cc2"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Auto",
			"Date": "2026-05-14T02:44:25Z",
			"File": [
